Tô Lâm
Vietnam's
communist party congress
re-elects
Tô Lâm
(pictured)
as
general secretary
, the most powerful position in the
one-party state
.
Iliana Iotova
becomes the first female
president of Bulgaria
following the resignation of
Rumen Radev
.
The United States leaves the
World Health Organization
.
Italian fashion designer
Valentino
, founder of
his eponymous fashion house
, dies at the age of 93.
