Sinking of MV
Trisha Kerstin 3
Philippine
officials ground the fleet of passenger ships belonging to
Aleson Shipping Lines
, owner of the sunken ferry
Trisha Kerstin 3
.
(AP via CTV News)
(GMA News)
Lugojel car crash
[
ro
]
Seven people are killed and three injured after a minibus carrying
Greek
PAOK FC
fans crashes on
E70
in
Timiș County
,
Romania
.
(AP)
(Caliber)
Four
Cuban
nationals are killed and another is injured in a fire at an unlicensed migrant
