Embargo of Russian oil during the Russo-Ukrainian war
,
France–Russia relations
French
authorities place the
Indian
captain of an
oil tanker
intercepted by the
French Navy
in the Mediterranean Sea under questioning on suspicion of
breaching sanctions
on
Russian oil
shipments, while prosecutors open a preliminary inquiry after the vessel arrives at anchorage near
Marseille
and its crew remains aboard.
(AP)
Three gunmen fire a
rocket-propelled grenade
at an armored SUV and open fire in an
ambush
against a convoy carrying the mayor of
Shariff Aguak
,
Maguindanao del Sur
,
Philippines
, injuring two security forces. The three perpetrators are later killed in a
shootout
with security forces.
(
Sunstar
)
