American climber
Alex Honnold
free-solo climbs
the
Taipei 101
skyscraper in
Taiwan
, setting the record for the highest free solo climb of an urban structure, after completing the 508 m (1,667 ft) climb during a
livestreamed
event.
(AFP via
The Sun
)
(Reuters)
